sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as "Admin"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant App as "applicationService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Admin->>UI: Create/edit/activate/deactivate promotion
    UI->>+API: POST/PUT /api/v1/promotions
    API->>App: Validate period, scope and discount rule
    App->>DB: Check historical-order immutability and overlap
    alt Valid promotion
        App->>DB: Save versioned promotion and audit
        API-->>-UI: Promotion result
    else Invalid or historical lock
        API-->>UI: 400/409 error
    end


